   219	### 3.2 The kill (new)
   220	
   221	`box/minor-residue-20260903/charts/moh1612_kill.sing`, `moh1612_order.sing`. Building
   222	`f, g` verbatim, `J = f_x g_y - f_y g_x`, and requiring every non-constant `x,y`-monomial
   223	of `J` to vanish gives 67 distinct generators `I` in 17 unknowns, with Jacobian constant
   224	
   225	```text
   226	cst = c13 * ( 3 b3 b4^2 + b3^2 c3 + b2 b4 c3 + b3 c4 + b2 c8 + b1 c9 ).
   227	```
