    15	**The `D = 108` principal-minor split classification is a single branch.**
    16	
    17	```text
    18	COMPLETE[108-SPLIT-ORDERS]  delta = 3 is the ONLY admissible split order in
    19	                            the detector window (1, v_s/u_s) = (1, 7/2) under
    20	                            N5 (den(delta) <= u_s = 2)
    21	EXCLUDED[108-DELTA-3/2 | -2 | -5/2]   each by two independent routes
    22	SURVIVES[108-DELTA-3]       partition [1,1]; face p = pi^2 - c (c != 0),
    23	                            q = p^23 u with u' = 5 p^2, deg u = 5;
    24	                            1-parameter mod gauge (the constant e_0 of u)
    25	OPEN[108-DELTA-3-LIFT]      global lift unproved; not a Keller witness
    26	OPEN[MINOR-RADIUS-108]      delta* <= 3 on the split branch, delta* >= 7/2 on
    27	                            the no-split alternative
