   362	## 5. FALLACY-v2 audit
   363	
   364	*Flag/place/series*: major radii `(3/8,1/4,-1)`, split order `delta`, combined
   365	radius `delta*`, and the denominators `A_j` are kept distinct; §2.3 states the
   366	`delta`/`delta*` dichotomy without identifying them, and the ceiling `7/2` (on
   367	`delta`, from `ord g < 0`) is never identified with the floor `V_s/u_s = 7/2`
   368	(on the *final* `delta_sigma`, N11) though the values coincide.
   369	*Carrier/attainment*: "alive"/"survives" is a screen result and a face
   370	representative, never `FULL_ACTUAL_EXIT`.  *Floor/attainment*: `IM = 21` is the
   371	all-major evaluation, used only to check Cor. 5.3 passes, so no kill rests on
   372	it; the budget `sum r_i <= deg q` is necessary, and both survivors `(26,23)`,
   373	`(23,23)` are exhibited by an explicit `q`.  *`sat()`*: no ideal was saturated
   374	here; §3 declares the Rabinowitsch form `Zc*c - 1` for the engine lane.
   375	*Prime label/derivative*: `p'`, `q'`, `u'` are `d/dpi`, stated at first use.
   376	*Variable/ring map*: the `(y,z)` map is Moh p.194's `z = y - bx - e`, `b != 0`;
   377	`w = z+1` is the engine's coordinate; the `pi`-gauge is given with its action
