   379	`delta = 3` — exactly why it is *not* available at `(99,66)`'s `5/2`.
   380	*Raw remainder degree*: the budget enumerates resonant and non-resonant
   381	branches at every root rather than dropping leaders, and `r >= 1` is proved.
   382	*Merge-free/M-descent*, *target/arrival index*: not touched.  No exit-price
   383	assertion is made, so no `charge_basis` line.
