   306	### 2.2-2.3 Tschirnhausen omissions; target translations
   307	
   308	The omissions are canonical (sec 1.1, Prop 1.2), not a gauge. The target
   309	translations preserve `J` and the leading forms, changing only `A3(0,0)`,
   310	`B2(0,0)`; available and unused.
