   750	(`gcd(12,18,10,25) = 1` forces `p` and `q` to be powers of a common linear
   751	factor). So (B) is a complete configuration, not a stage of a longer tower.
   752	
   753	(A),(B),(C) are mutually exclusive (`p` is a linear power, or has exactly two, or
   754	exactly three distinct roots), and Steps 1-5 leave nothing else. QED
