+### 5.4 Same open is not the same element or mechanism
+
+The exact common statement is
+
+```text
+D(9rho^2) = D(rho),       A[(9rho^2)^(-1)] = A[rho^(-1)],
+D(4c^3)   = D(c),         A[(4c^3)^(-1)]   = A[c^(-1)].
