+```text
+6264 = (-8)*(-783),       783 = e*A*(K-ell) = 27*(33-4).
+```
+
+Here `-8` is an affine pole-row offset and `29=33-4` is a band-index
+complement.  Neither involves the root separation `rho`.  The charged integral
