+### 5.3 `(99,66), delta=5/2`: `64` is a later Schur normal form
+
+At the audited post-outer-`D_2`, common-`h3` quotient boundary, a 43-square
+`B1` block consists of eight outer-`D_1` rows and 35 Jacobian rows.  Its pivot
