+# MINOR-EMPTY and the discriminant of the principal-minor leader
+
+Lane: `minor-empty-disc-sol56-20260903`
+Date: 2026-09-04 UTC
+Frozen basis: `158179af4a89e193c843f823bdea21396af1920c`
