+```text
+q_1' + 2p^3 = 0,       p=pi(pi^2-c).
+```
+
+For every `p`, take `q_1=-2 integral(p^3 d pi)+e_0`.  Exact CAS gave residual
+`0`, `deg q_1=10`, and
+
+```text
+disc(p)=4c^3.
+```
+
+Choosing `c=1` again gives a nondegenerate sourced solution.  Xu explicitly
